---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SourcesNote from "../components/SourcesNote.astro";
import { figures, ledger, projects, site } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout title={site.name} description={site.description}>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-pine text-paper">
    <div class="hero-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-4 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] md:px-6 md:py-24">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.16em] text-[#e7c2a4] uppercase">
          Bastrop County, Texas
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-display mt-4 text-[3.1rem] leading-[0.98] text-paper md:text-7xl">
          Billions on the tax roll.
          <span class="mt-1 block italic text-[#f0d2ba]">Almost nothing asked back.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/78">
          Data centers are the rare project that widens the tax base and barely uses the services that tax base pays
          for. Schools get the revenue without the students. The county gets a commercial payer that brings its own
          security, its own fire suppression, and, at Pacifico, its own power plant.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/tax-base" class="rounded-full bg-copper px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-paper no-underline hover:bg-copper-deep">
            See the tax math
          </a>
          <a href="/footprint" class="rounded-full border border-paper/30 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-paper no-underline hover:bg-white/10">
            What residents provide
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="ticket ticket-top rounded-sm px-6 pt-8 pb-6" aria-label="Commercial tax ledger">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted uppercase">Bastrop County · Commercial roll</p>
        <h2 class="font-display mt-2 text-3xl text-ink">What the land pays</h2>
        <dl class="mt-4">
          {
            ledger.map((row) => (
              <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-x-4 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3">
                <dt>
                  <span class="block text-sm font-medium">{row.label}</span>
                  <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs text-muted">{row.detail}</span>
                </dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-pine">{row.value}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Published by Building Bastrop County. The two money rows are different projects and different time windows.
          They are not a combined annual bill.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="border-b border-line px-4 py-8 md:border-r md:border-b-0 md:px-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-2xl text-pine">{figures.combinedInvestment}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Combined investment published for the EdgeConneX and Pacifico campuses in Cedar Creek.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="border-b border-line px-4 py-8 md:border-r md:border-b-0 md:px-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-2xl text-pine">{figures.pacificoPower}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          On-site generation at Pacifico. That campus is described as drawing nothing from the shared grid.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="px-4 py-8 md:px-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-2xl text-pine">{figures.usFreshwater}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Share of U.S. freshwater used by every American data center combined, in 2023.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="kicker">The bargain</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">They pay in. They barely draw out.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        A house pays tax and then sends children to school, cars onto the farm-to-market roads, and calls to fire and
        EMS. A data center pays tax and then mostly takes care of itself.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-3xl bg-pine p-7 text-paper">
        <h3 class="font-display text-3xl">What they contribute</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/85">
          <li>Property tax far beyond what the same acres paid as raw land — {figures.priorAnnualTax} a year before.</li>
          <li>School revenue without a matching wave of enrollment.</li>
          <li>A commercial share of the county levy, so houses are not the only payer.</li>
          <li>{figures.constructionJobs} construction jobs in each build phase, then permanent technical pay of {figures.payRange}.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-paper p-7">
        <h3 class="font-display text-3xl">What they ask of residents</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          <li>Minimal new students, against {figures.subdivisionStudents} from a 1,000-home subdivision.</li>
          <li>Minimal daily traffic once construction crews go home.</li>
          <li>On-site security and fire suppression, instead of a new neighborhood of emergency calls.</li>
          <li>Closed-loop water. Pacifico is published at {figures.pacificoLues} living-unit equivalents, not a town’s worth of taps.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm">
      <a class="font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href="/footprint">The full footprint, resource by resource</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-line bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-20">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">Cedar Creek</p>
          <h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl">Two campuses, one county roll</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/corridor" class="text-sm font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">Both projects</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        {
          projects.map((project) => (
            <a href={`/corridor#${project.id}`} class="group rounded-3xl border border-line bg-sand p-6 no-underline hover:border-copper">
              <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.14em] text-copper-deep uppercase">{project.status}</p>
              <h3 class="font-display mt-2 text-3xl text-ink group-hover:text-copper-deep">{project.name}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">{project.place}</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/80">{project.summary}</p>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-24">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Schools and the night shift</p>
        <h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">The money stays. The demand does not.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="copy space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Building Bastrop County’s plain version of the school math: a data center puts millions into the local ISD
          without adding a class of students. Teacher pay, buildings, and classroom technology are what that revenue
          is for. A subdivision spends the new tax dollars on the children it brought.
        </p>
        <p>
          Emergency services work the same way. The campuses fund their own security and suppression. The commercial
          tax can buy engines and staff for Elgin, Smithville, Cedar Creek, and Bastrop, because the project is not a
          new subdivision of medical calls.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/tax-base">How the abatement and the full-rate campus differ</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <SourcesNote />
  </section>
</Layout>
